    "detailed_description": "<strong>How are you, Paco? How are you? It's me Er Pelusa</strong>. <br>You told me that if I knew of any job to let you know, so I got you a good job. <br><br><strong>You're going to work delivering butane gas:</strong><br>You have a license, don't you, because you're going to have to drive the van loaded with butane around the neighborhood.<br>- You can tune the van if you want.<br>- Remember to put gas in it<br>- Distribute the butane to the neighbors in the neighborhood, so they can take a hot shower.<br>- You can use the wheelbarrow to go faster<br>- We'll give you a helper so you can put him to deliver butane, load the truck or send him to buy tobacco.<br>- If you're going to take a shit, go to the nearest toilet.<br>- You have a radio so play whatever music you want on it.<br>- And above all don't buy anything from the beggars in the neighborhood.<br><br><strong>Ala Paco have a good picha</strong>.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>How are you, Paco? How are you? It's me Er Pelusa</strong>. <br>You told me that if I knew of any job to let you know, so I got you a good job. <br><br><strong>You're going to work delivering butane gas:</strong><br>You have a license, don't you, because you're going to have to drive the van loaded with butane around the neighborhood.<br>- You can tune the van if you want.<br>- Remember to put gas in it<br>- Distribute the butane to the neighbors in the neighborhood, so they can take a hot shower.<br>- You can use the wheelbarrow to go faster<br>- We'll give you a helper so you can put him to deliver butane, load the truck or send him to buy tobacco.<br>- If you're going to take a shit, go to the nearest toilet.<br>- You have a radio so play whatever music you want on it.<br>- And above all don't buy anything from the beggars in the neighborhood.<br><br><strong>Ala Paco have a good picha</strong>.",
    "short_description": "I got you a job delivering butane. You will have to drive the delivery van, pump gas and deliver fast with the forklift. You will have a helper for miscellaneous tasks. Remember to use the nearest bathroom and put your music on the radio. Don't buy anything from beggars. Good luck!",
    "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
